@7357. Those in Hell, from whom have been taken away the truths they had known, cannot but speak falsities.

@7482[end]. By the coming (of the angelic Spirits of Mars) the communication was taken away.

@7502[2]. Lest they should apply the things of the light of Heaven to defend falsities and evils, everything of that kind is taken away.

