@10031[2]. Grief on account of truth destroyed, is signified by, "Mine eyes are consumed with tears" (Lamentations 2:11).

@HH 238. A hard-hearted Spirit was so affected by the speech of an Angel that he shed tears. He said it was love speaking, and that he had never shed tears before.

